+// XP walk: the upstream Windows spellchecker is built on the Win8 ISpellChecker
+// COM API (<spellcheck.h>, Windows 8+), which is unavailable on Windows XP.
+// Provide a no-op implementation so spellchecking is simply disabled on the XP
+// build -- every word reports as correct and no suggestions are produced. This
+// is acceptable degradation for XP (see WALK_FORWARD_PLAN feature-disable).
 
